<title>USA: Industrial says retains D.H. Blair.</title>
<headline>Industrial says retains D.H. Blair.</headline>
<dateline>TRUMBULL, Conn. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial Technologies Inc said Thursday it retained D.H. Blair Investment Banking Corp to act as its financial adviser and investment banker to help with mergers and acquisitions.</p>
<p>The company said D.H. Blair Investment Banking Corp is a Wall Street investment banking firm that works with technology-oriented companies on IPO's and private placements.</p>
<p>A company spokesman declined to discuss the terms of the deal with D.H. Blair.</p>
</text>
